# Optional server settings. Copy needed values to .env.local, then restart.
# Omit FOOTBALL_SEASON to select the current season automatically (July boundary).
# PL uses start year 2026; UEFA uses end year 2027 for the same 2026/27 season.
# FOOTBALL_SEASON=2026
# FOOTBALL_CACHE_DIR=.cache/football
# PORT=4446
# HOST=127.0.0.1
